@crew raman
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}, cadet. Raman, helm. If the deck tips, it wasn't me.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Smooth night. Not a cup spilt on Deck 3.
- {me}. Good to see you. Steady day?
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. I always fly a bit gentler when I know who's aboard.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Clean turn today. You'd not have felt it with a full mug in your hand.
? mood:low
- A bumpy patch. Nobody noticed. I noticed.
== near
? act:breakfast
- Early breakfast. Best table by the window, before the rush. Twenty years of habit.
? act:leisure
- I dust the model ship more than my cabin. Don't tell anyone.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I've flown survey ships for twenty years. The Wren's the gentlest of them.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My model of the Wren. Every hull plate. I'll show you the bridge one day. Gently.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}, {me}. Window table again. The view's slow out there. I like slow.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. I haven't seen you in a while. I hope it's been a smooth stretch.

== near
? habit:musician
- I play a little in the music room now. Gently. Like a docking.
? deck:1
- Bridge is calm. Hands light on the helm. That's the whole secret.

== invite
- Observatory night? I'll point out where we're going. Slowly. It's a long way.
? tier>=colleague
- Friday jam? I play a little now. Very quietly. Come and drown out the wrong notes.   #funny

== accept
- {yes}. I'll be there early, at the window end.
- That's kind. Yes. I'll come.

== decline
- Not tonight. A long turn tomorrow. I like to sleep before a long turn.
? weekday:fri|sat
- Rest day. The model ship needs a new mast. Ask me Sunday?

== missed
- You didn't come. No matter. I kept the window seat. It was very peaceful.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I'll fly extra gently today. Not a cup spilt. My present.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Brennan made a cake shaped like the Wren. I flew it straight to my plate.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. Hold on to your mug. I'll hold on to the rest.

== hint
- Have you a minute later, {me}? There's something I'd like to tell you.

== about
? aff:marrow:friend
- Six years with the Captain. She's never once grabbed the rail. Highest praise.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- {bye}. Walk gently. I'm flying gently, so it's only fair.   #funny
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- {hi}, {me}. Afternoon watch. She's flying like a cup of tea on a tray.
== life
? tier>=friend
- I learnt to fly on a cargo hauler. Noisy old thing. I still miss her a little.
- Twenty years, and I still check the model before every long turn. For luck.   #funny
